+    /// Install a non-resident prefix into an acquired, EMPTY paged slot
+    /// (freshly acquired or cleared with [`Self::reset`]). Allocates only a
+    /// CPU logical table of `ceil(frontier / PAGE_TOKENS)` [`SPILLED_PAGE`]
